    "subagent": "Harness-native child of the primary; no separate home or task"
  },
  "starting_state": [
    "An empty space owned by the primary person; the other person is a contributor."
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "turn": "Draft a team review checklist titled Review the team checklist. Ask a subagent to identify two risks while you draft two mitigations, then combine both into your answer. Finish that work.",
